  "scope": "Native bounded incremental wire parser, single-frame encoder and plaintext message reassembly. Opaque encrypted frames accepted by parser only; plaintext assembler refuses ciphertext without mutation. No fake decrypt, crypto, TLS/authentication, automatic outbound fragmentation, channel/Protobuf/H264/UI, real USB/current phone/Garmin loaded execution or installation. Caller-provided real memory pools, single actor/unique session/unborrowed init/nonoverlapping storage remain contracts; no real RAM allocation verified."
